  "body": "## Pulse Music v3.2.4 - Listen Together Crash Fix & Real-Time OTA Overhaul\n\n### \u2261\u0192\u00dc\u00c7 Listen Together Crash & Stability Resolution\n- **Resolved NullPointerException on Android 16 (SDK 36)**: Eliminated uninitialized reference in `ListenTogetherSettingsViewModel` and room membership callbacks when inspecting participant rosters.\n- **Null-Safe Member & Avatar Rendering**: Hardened avatar tint and username initial resolution with defensive fallbacks, preventing frame draw crashes in Compose `WorkArea`.\n- **RenderNode & Shader Boundary Guard**: Enhanced backdrop graphics layer recording in `LiquidGlass.kt` with fault-tolerant execution, ensuring flawless rendering on cutting-edge Android runtime shader targets.\n- **IO Dispatcher Threading**: Bound all DataStore operations in Listen Together ViewModels directly to `Dispatchers.IO` to ensure smooth 60fps UI frame rendering.\n\n### \u0393\u00dc\u00ed Overhauled Real-Time OTA Update Engine\n- **CDN Edge Cache-Busting**: Added high-precision millisecond timestamp query params to GitHub raw release feeds to bypass stale intermediate edge caches.\n- **Multi-Endpoint Highest-Version Arbitrator**: Refactored `AppUpdateWorker` and `UpdateRepositoryImpl` to query raw endpoints, GitHub releases API, and CDN concurrently, selecting the newest version available instead of halting on stale cache hits.\n- **Instant Notification Delivery**: Older versions (v3.2.2 and prior) now immediately detect the latest version and display the system notification and update banner.\n\n### \u2261\u0192\u00f4\u00aa Artifacts & Checksums\n- `PulseMusic-arm64-v8a.apk`: Optimized for modern 64-bit Android smartphones & tablets.\n- `PulseMusic-universal.apk`: Universal multi-ABI package for all Android devices.\n- `PulseMusic-armeabi-v7a.apk`: 32-bit legacy devices.\n- `PulseMusic-x86_64.apk`: Emulators and ChromeOS / x86_64 devices.\n"
